<title>GERMANY: Merk sees strong 1996 profit gain.</title>
<headline>Merk sees strong 1996 profit gain.</headline>
<dateline>DARMSTADT, Germany 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and drugs group Merck KGaA said on Tuesday it expected &quot;a further significant profit gain in 1996&quot;.</p>
<p>The forecast was contained in a mandatory statement giving sales data for the period.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +4969 756525</p>
</text>
